      "extract": "arXiv:hep-th/9306069v2 28 Jun 1993 SU-ITP-93-15 June 1993 hep-th/9306069 The Stretched Horizon and Black Hole Complementarity Leonard Susskind, ⋆L´arus Thorlacius, † and John Uglum ‡ Department of Physics Stanford University, Stanford, CA 94305-4060",
